      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OHOKA DREAM (2) resumes off strong form in Brisbane over the winter, winning three of his last four outings at Albion Park. Owns a strong fresh record and a good draw can see him measure up. REWATCH (8) worked from this barrier and faded last start but should find this easier. Capable three-year-old is a two-time winner at this circuit and distance. Player if things go his way. HOPPALONGPOG (1) has been racing consistently, going under narrowly from this barrier at Bathurst last start. Should enjoy a soft run so can be competitive. IDEAL TIMING (6) draws wider than in last week's second but that added to a series of top-four results so the consistency must be respected. NUGGET ROGERS (3) didn't miss by much last start and draws to play a role again.",
